pod_rpg.guide.changelog.body=Current Version: §sRPG Skills v%1
pod_rpg.guide.changelog.1.0.7=- Added 'Skills Cheat' item to modify skill levels. (Creative Only)%1- Added 'Changelog' to Guide Book.%1- Updated some phrasing in the language.%1- Improved compatibility with other add-ons.%1- Improved mount despawning from the 'Mount Call' ability.%1- Improved arrow detection.%1- Improved pathfinding of arrows shot while the 'Aim Assist' ability is active.%1- Improved explosion accuracy and performance.%1- Renamed the 'Submit' button to the 'Save' button in the settings menu.%1- Added a warning to the settings menu when closed without saving.
pod_rpg.guide.changelog.1.0.8=- Fixed a bug where 'picking' a crop would be rewarded even though it was not picked.%1- Fixed a bug where Visitors would receive EXP from try to use a Flint and Steel.%1- Fixed a bug with the 'Tree Feller' Lumberjack ability.%1- Made the 'Homecoming' Explorer ability default to the world spawn when the player's bed is obstructed.%1- Made the 'Regrowth' Lumberjack ability work on trees from the 'FARMING' Add-On.
pod_rpg.guide.changelog.subtitle=§lUpdate v%1§r
