pod_rpg.ui.main.body1=The RPG Skills Add-On adds 9 Skills and 27 unique Abilities to the game, that can be levelled by the player and enhance everyone's game experience!
pod_rpg.ui.main.body2=In this menu, you can find everything you need to use this Add-On!
pod_rpg.ui.guide.body1=In the RPG Skills Add-On, there are 9 unique skills. You can find all information on them in their skill page. Each Skill has a passive ability that will be automatically levelled as you proceed.
pod_rpg.ui.guide.body2=Additionally, every skill has 3 abilities that can be progessively unlocked and levelled. You can select one ability at a time. Some abilities have to be enabled, you can find information on how to enable these on their skill page.
pod_rpg.ui.guide.body3=Some features can be disabled in the settings, such as particles and more. We recommend to only change these settings if you know what you are doing as they might impact your gameplay.
pod_rpg.ui.guide.body4=If you ever lose this book, you can simply craft a new one by combining a book with a pickaxe of any type in your crafting grid. Please note that the pickaxe will be lost.
