pod_rpg.skills.pyromaniac.passive.description=You have a %1 chance to regain any health lost by fire damage. This rate increases as you level up! If the damage is fatal, you will not be saved from death!
pod_rpg.skills.pyromaniac.abilities.description=Sneak twice while holding a flint/flint and steel or double right click, to enable your pyromaniac ability.
