pod_rpg.abilities.magma_walker.name=Magma Walker
pod_rpg.abilities.magma_walker.description=While this ability is active, lava below the player will be turned into magma blocks. This will allow the player to walk over the lava! Be aware though, magma blocks still hurt you! The blocks will disappear after %1 seconds unless you are still standing on them.
