pod_rpg.skills.archer.name=Archer
pod_rpg.skills.archer.description=The Archer skill can be levelled by shooting arrows. You will receive exp for every arrow you shoot, additionally you will receive exp when you hit an entity with the arrow, where the amount of exp received increased based on your distance to the entity. You can access this menu through the Add-On Book or by double right clicking with an arrow while sneaking.
pod_rpg.skills.archer.passive.description=The damage you deal when shooting arrows increases by %1!
pod_rpg.skills.archer.abilities.description=Sneak twice while holding a bow/an arrow or double right click, to enable your archer ability. Abilities that get charged will be used once you shoot with your bow again. They remain charged for 60 seconds or until you shoot. You can also uncharge them by re-enabling the ability
