pod_rpg.abilities.explosive_arrow.name=Explosive Arrow
pod_rpg.abilities.explosive_arrow.description=When this ability is charged, the next bow shot will shoot an explosive arrow! By default, this explosion will break blocks, but you can disable explosion block damage in the Add-On settings.
