pod_rpg.abilities.arrow_shield.name=Arrow Shield
pod_rpg.abilities.arrow_shield.description=While this ability is active, arrows will spawn in a circle around the player. The wind the arrows create keep mobs away from you. The ability lasts %1 seconds.
