pod_rpg.skills.hunting.name=Hunting
pod_rpg.skills.hunting.description=The Hunting skill can be levelled by hunting animals. You will receive a different amount of exp based on what animal you killed. You can access this menu through the Add-On Book or by double right clicking with shears/leather/a feather while sneaking.
pod_rpg.skills.hunting.passive.description=When killing animals, there is a §q%1 §rchance that an additional item drops. This rate increases as you level up!
pod_rpg.skills.hunting.abilities.description=Sneak twice while holding shears/leather/a feather or double right click, to enable your hunting ability.
