pod_rpg.guide.changelog.3.0.1=- Improvements to the Binding Modification Menu.%1- Abilities that the player has not unlocked yet can now no longer be enabled through bindings.%1- Buffed passive ability values are displayed correctly on the Skill Info Page now.%1- Fixed an issue with attempting to create Bindings using Item Tags.%1- Fixed an issue where Bindings with the action "Show Progress" would be described to enable the selected Ability.%1- Fixed an issue where releasing the sneak button would be counted as button press on some devices.%1- Fixed an issue where releasing the jump button would be counted as button press on some devices.%1- Fixed an issue where the remaining duration of the Tree Feller Ability would not display.
